$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: (22) Typical Procedure. To a suspension of
indium powder (0.115 g, 1 mmol) in THF (1 mL) was added
1-acetoxy-3-bromo-1-propene 3 (0.175 mL, 1.5 mmol) at 0 °C. The
heterogeneous mixture was stirred for 30 min at 0 °C, the ice bath was
removed, and stirring was continued for 3.5 h at room temperature. The
aldehyde was added (1 mmol) at 0 °C, and the reaction mixture was stirred
for 4 h at 0 °C. Syn-1-Phenyl-but-3-en-1,2-diol (Syn-6a).
Syn-1-(2-Furyl)-but-3-en-1,2-diol (Syn-6h).
Anti-1-(2-Furyl)-but-3-en-1,2-diol (Anti-6h).
Syn-1-(2-Furyl)-but-3-en-1,2-diol (Syn-6h). 1H NMR (200 MHz, CDCl3) δ
2.54 (s, 1H), 2.75 (s, 1H), 4.43-4.51 (m, 1H), 4.56 (dd, J = 5.0/7.0 Hz,
1H), 5.22 (dt, J = 1.8/10.5 Hz, 1H), 5.35 (dt, J = 1.8/17.2 Hz, 1H), 5.80
(ddd, J = 5.2/10.5/17.2 Hz, 1H), 6.33-6.39 (m, 2H), 7.40-7.43 (m, 1H);
13C NMR (50 MHz, CDCl3) δ 70.9, 74.5, 108.0, 110.1, 117.1, 135.8, 142.1,
153.0. Anti-1-(2-Furyl)-but-3-en-1,2-diol (Anti-6h). 1H NMR (200 MHz,
CDCl3) δ 4.40-4.46 (m, 1H), 4.75 (t, J = 5.4 Hz, 1H), 5.23 (dt, J =
1.4/10.5 Hz, 1H), 5.39 (dt, J = 1.4/17.2 Hz, 1H), 5.87 (ddd, J =
5.6/10.5/17.2 Hz, 1H), 6.32-6.39 (m, 2H), 7.40-7.42 (m, 1H); 13C NMR (50
MHz, CDCl3) δ 70.7, 74.7, 107.7, 110.1, 117.4, 135.6, 117.4, 135.6,
141.9, 153.0.
