$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: Representative Procedure for the Allylboration
of Aldehydes with 1a. (-)-(R)-3-Methyl-1-(2-chlorophenyl)-3-buten-1-ol
(6Rd): A solution of
B-Methallyl-10R-trimethylsilyl-9-borabicyclo[3.3.2]decane (0.79 g, 3
mmol) in THF (3 mL) was cooled to -78 °C and 2-chlorobenzaldehyde (0.42
g, 3.0 mmol) was added dropwise. After 3 h, the solvents were removed
under vacuum. Product 1, yield 66% and product 2, yield 78%.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM stereoselective
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
