$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Synthesis of (2E,4Z,6S,7R)-allyl
6,7,8-trihydroxy-2-methylocta-2,4-dienoate, 28: Compound 9 (2.65 g, 11.5
mmol) and ylide 27 (6.5 g, 17.4 mmol) were added into THF (75 ml),
respectively. The solution was heated at reflux overnight and
concentrated directly. The crude ester was used in subsequent reactions
directly. To a solution of the crude unsaturated ester in EtOH (45 ml)
and H2O (4.5 ml), K2CO3 (8 g, 58 mmol) was added. The mixture was stirred
for 1.5 h, and then diluted with 20 ml H2O, and extracted with DCM (5 x
60 ml). The organic layers were combined and dried with Na2SO4, filtered
and concentrated. The residue was purified by flash chromatography
(DCM/Methanol: 30/1) to yield triol 28. Colorless oil, yield (2.32 g, 83%
for two steps). 1H NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3) δ = 7.46 (d, J = 12.0, 1H), 6.45
(t, J = 11.6, 1H), 6.00 - 5.89 (m, 1H), 5.89 - 5.82 (m, 1H), 5.32 (d, J =
17.2, 1H), 5.24 (d, J = 10.4, 1H), 4.82 (d, J = 5.6, 1H), 4.65 (d, J =
5.6, 2H), 3.77 - 3.68 (m, 3H), 3.58 (s, 3H), 1.95 (s, 3H); 13C NMR (125
MHz, CDCl3) δ = 168.3, 136.4, 132.5, 132.2, 129.5, 126.2, 118.2, 74.3,
69.5, 65.7, 63.1, 12.5; IR (neat): 3394, 2929, 1707, 1256, 1095, 749
cm-1; HRMS (ESI) (m/z): [M+Na]+ calcd for C12H18O5Na: 265.1046, found:
265.1045; [α]20 D −34.62 (c = 0.52, CHCl3).
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM stereoselective (stage 1)
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Total Synthesis of Herbimycin A
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Yan, Rui; Bian, Chuancai; Yu, Xiaoming
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Organic Letters (2014), 16(12), 3280-3283

