(m), 843 (m), 752 (s), 695 (s) MS: (FI) 228 (M+, 40), 211 (15), 210 (100)
Opt. Rot.: [α]D 24 -52.73° (c = 1.43, EtOH) TLC: Rf 0.16 (hexanes/EtOAc,
3/2) [UV (254 nm)] SFC: (4R,7R)-22 tr 4.91 min (84.5%); (4S,7S)-22 tr
